Z||000000||PaUL||04-08-99||06:39 PM||||I just have to tell everyone about this great car racing game I got a few months ago. Its called Need for Speed III from Electronic Arts. This game is great because it allows you to create your own custom cars. A guy named Stratto made a Fiero model for this game. The car looks ok except for the roof and the sides. I wrote Stratto about this, he said he used the Ferrari model as the base for the Fiero and that hes still working on it. I get a kick out of playing this game. You race against real production cars as well as the creations of other people. I downloaded an Audi Avis concept car model, man this thing is fast, no way I can keep up in the Fiero. <p>By the way, Im a big software pirate, I got the game for free. I never ever bought a single piece of software. If anyone wants this game drop me a private line and Ill introduce you to the fantastic world of WAREZ<br>
